        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock LCK-JPSTD1 Jimmy Proof Locks\r\n</b>\r\n<p>\r\nJimmy proof apartment locks, aka New York City Apartment Locks, because of their wide uses on front apartment doors in the big apple. They prevent the door from being \"Jimmied\" open (pried open) with a crow bar by securely locking your door to the door frame.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/mul-t-lock-single-cylinder-jimmy-proof-apartment-deadlock\"><b>Single Cylinder Jimmy Proof Lock</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nHigh security surface mounted deadlock protection. Locks by the inside thumb turn. Supplied with matching finish mounting screws in your choice of Bright Brass or Bright Chrome finish. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Mul-T-Lock LCK-JPSTD1 Jimmy Proof Lock\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 4.49\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2.87\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 1.18\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Bright Brass</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KW-JPSTD1.pdf?v=1704262212\" target=\"new\"><b>Mul-T-Lock LCK-JPSTD1 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued. None available.</b>\r\n</p>",
